Gene Expression Dynamics In a Cell-Free System.md
Modeling Cell-Free RNA and Protein Systhesis with Minimal Systems.pdf
Modeling Cell-Free RNA and Protein Systhesis with Minimal Systems.md

# Ordinary simulation run outputs: reproducible from their manifests, never
# versioned. Only results/baselines/ and results/releases/ are committed.
results/runs/*
!results/runs/README.md

# Scratch test/run logs at the repo root (deliberately committed evidence
# lives in docs/audit/logs/)
/logs/

